  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="unit_load_cb771f640f44dcf3e8a3f896ded99688be542fe0404e21ef0d72aea0cf2e98c176">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>load, the specific quantity of a substance which it is customary to load at one time; hence, taken as a unit of measure or weight for fletcher's timber (wood for making arrows) | the specific quantity of a substance which it is custumary to load at one time, a unit of measure of wood (OED s.v. load n. 2b), here of alabaster | load, the specific quantity of a substance (here: alabaster) which it is custumary to load at one time (OED s.v. load n. 2b) | meaning unknown | load, the specific quantity of a substance (here: wood) which it is custumary to load at one time, a unit of measure of wood (OED s.v. load n. 2b)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
